The frontend's 06:30Z item 7. Approved in §128 (Misho's „ყველა კი", 11
Oct) with the texts in NIGHT_QUESTIONS BH.

Once a month at most, a person whose reminder switch is on (0074) and
whose last real import is over 30 days old is rung once, at noon on one
of their devices' own clock, in their own language, opening /profile. A
person who never imported is not reminded. The due people are claimed
in one UPDATE … RETURNING (migration 236: contact_import_reminded_at), so
two processes never ring the same person; a sweep every 15 minutes
catches each zone's noon. One failed push never stops the next.

Checked read-only on live: the selection runs; nobody has the switch on
yet, so nobody is rung until somebody turns it on.

